<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quality Dining cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quality Dining cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim said it downgraded Quality Dining Inc to perform in line from outperform significantly.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1-1/8 to 11-5/8.</p>
